BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Mirror Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  In ancient times, there existed a sacred spring called the Mirror of Echoes. When a traveler c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    ast a coin into its waters, the spring would triple it-but the coins would appear on the opp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    osite shore, where another traveler stood.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  The first traveler, seeing this magic, faced a choice: cast nothing and keep their meager coin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    , or trust the spring and the stranger across the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  One day, a generous soul named Aria cast all five of her coins into the spring. They multiplie) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    d, and fifteen coins appeared before the stranger, Kael. Moved by this trust, Kael returned ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    half-not out of obligation, but gratitude.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  The spring whispered: *"This is the dance of abundance-one gives, the cosmos multiplies, and t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    he other returns. Together, both prosper beyond what either could achieve alone."*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  But the spring was ancient and sometimes distorted reflections, making gifts appear larger or ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    smaller than they were. Yet the wise travelers understood: judge not by imperfect echoes, bu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    t by the intentions rippling through the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  When trust flows freely and returns generously, the spring never runs dry. Both shores flouris) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    h, and the cycle continues-for in giving without guarantee, we receive beyond measure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
