BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  In ancient times, two rivers flowed through separate valleys-the River of Giving and the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (     of Return. Each was guarded by a spirit who possessed five golden seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  The Spirit of Giving discovered a sacred truth: any seed planted in the other's valley would b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    loom threefold. But to plant required crossing the treacherous mountain, relinquishing the s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    eed forever into another's care.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  The Spirit of Return, upon receiving these miraculous blooms, faced a choice: keep all fifteen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     flowers, or return some across the mountain to honor the trust placed in them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  At first, the Spirit of Giving sent nothing, fearing loss. Both valleys remained barren. Then,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (     tentatively, they sent one seed. It became three flowers. The Spirit of Return, moved by th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    is trust, sent two flowers back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  Each season, they refined their dance. When the Spirit of Giving sent more, both valleys flour) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ished. When the Spirit of Return honored the gift with fair return, trust deepened.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  The elders say: the mountain between us multiplies what we share, but only if we dare to give ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    and remember to return. Abundance flows not from hoarding our seeds, but from planting them ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    in each other's soil.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (  The user is asking me to write a 200-word myth that reflects how the game should be played, ba) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    sed on the game I've been playing. However, this is actually the first prompt I'm receiving ) Tj ET
