BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      In ancient times, two rivers flowed through separate valleys-the River of Giving and the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        iver of Return. Each was guarded by a spirit who possessed five golden seeds.) Tj ET
