BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        ng the seed forever into another's care.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      The Spirit of Return, upon receiving these miraculous blooms, faced a choice: keep all fif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        teen flowers, or return some across the mountain to honor the trust placed in them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      At first, the Spirit of Giving sent nothing, fearing loss. Both valleys remained barren. T) Tj ET
