BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    In ancient times, there existed a sacred spring called the Mirror of Echoes. When a traveler) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (       cast a coin into its waters, the spring would triple it-but the coins would appear on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (       opposite shore, where another traveler stood.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
