BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      in, or trust the spring and the stranger across the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    One day, a generous soul named Aria cast all five of her coins into the spring. They multipl) Tj ET
