BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (    The spring whispered: *"This is the dance of abundance-one gives, the cosmos multiplies, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (       the other returns. Together, both prosper beyond what either could achieve alone."*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    But the spring was ancient and sometimes distorted reflections, making gifts appear larger o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      r smaller than they were. Yet the wise travelers understood: judge not by imperfect echoes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      , but by the intentions rippling through the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
