BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      The first traveler, seeing this magic, faced a choice: cast nothing and keep their meager ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        coin, or trust the spring and the stranger across the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      One day, a generous soul named Aria cast all five of her coins into the spring. They multi) Tj ET
