BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      But the spring was ancient and sometimes distorted reflections, making gifts appear larger) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (         or smaller than they were. Yet the wise travelers understood: judge not by imperfect ec) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        hoes, but by the intentions rippling through the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
