BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      In ancient times, there existed a sacred spring called the Mirror of Echoes. When a travel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        er cast a coin into its waters, the spring would triple it-but the coins would appear on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (         the opposite shore, where another traveler stood.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      The first traveler, seeing this magic, faced a choice: cast nothing and keep their meager ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        coin, or trust the spring and the stranger across the water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      One day, a generous soul named Aria cast all five of her coins into the spring. They multi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        plied, and fifteen coins appeared before the stranger, Kael. Moved by this trust, Kael r) Tj ET
