BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The spring whispered: *"This is the dance of abundance-one gives, the cosmos multiplies, a) Tj ET
